            "review_title": "Review at Soho Steak 73 Pho Hue",
            "review_text": "Anouk G\n4 contributions\n0\nGood food, bad attitude towards their mistake\nDec 2024 • Friends\nFood is good, everything else not so much. Seated in a narrow entryway so people going past. I ordered the prawn pasta (a main dish, pasta stuck together and only two prawns) and the steak (which was good but I wanted the cheaper 200gm steak and they didn’t have stock so was told to get the more expensive steak and charged more). \n\nMy friend ordered the cheese sauce pasta with bacon and was given the prawn pasta (which she is allergic to). We had repeated our order several times so it wasn’t on our end. She told them she couldn’t eat it and didn’t order that: they kept talking to me instead I had to tell them multiple times to address her, they went away with the dish three times and came back and told us “the kitchen has made it now can’t you just help us and eat it?” And then they were acting annoyed about it. We said she was allergic and they said “we’ll just remove the two prawns and then you eat the pasta”. We had to insist on the correct dish being made.\n\nWe still tipped because the other food was okay and they gave us complimentary bread\nRead more\nWritten December 11, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
