            "review_title": "Review at Soho Steak 73 Pho Hue",
            "review_text": "Michele Francisco\nHong Kong, China130 contributions\n0\nDisappointed\nJan 2023\nI came solo without reservation. I was seated on the first floor, by the reception. Everybody coming in and out of the restaurant passed by my table. I don't know if it's about the restaurant being full and I can't be accommodated on the second floor or because I'm alone or maybe even because I'm Asian. I should have walked away after being seated and am banging my head for not doing so. I was craving for steak and from my Google search, saw that theirs is reasonably priced so wanted to try. Their Google review was not bad.\n\nI had the smoked salad with orange dressing and 200g medium rib eye steak with mushroom gravy. The salad was okay. The steak was a disappointment. It is very apparent in the photos that the meat was overcooked. I asked for medium, not medium-well to well done. The gravy had a very faint taste of mushroom. It tasted mostly like cream.\n\nNothing about this restaurant is recommendable.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 2, 2023",
