            "review_title": "Review at Soho Steak 73 Pho Hue",
            "review_text": "James Doyle\nHanoi, Vietnam45 contributions\n0\nAn Okay Place.......\nAug 2019\nWent there for Sunday lunch, ordered a draught beer, very small glass of beer for 59,000VND> Had a Caesar salad, which was very good, crispy croutons, nice dressing ,\na little grilled bacon; no evidence of cheese. Steak was good, cooked rare as ordered.\n\nI ordered a cheese sauce but unfortunately, the sauce was just a roux flour and probably oil, not butter, no cheese. I asked to see the chef and a very pleasant young man arrived and made me a new sauce. A huge problem in Vietnam is that they tend to be stingy with the cheese.\nPrice is very reasonable and the place is very clean and inviting.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 25, 2019\nSoho Steak\nThanks for your feedback on the Soho experience. We acknowledge these comments and will adjust them to better.\nHopefully, next time you will have a better experience at Soho\nRead more\nWritten August 26, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
