            "review_text": "Michael M\nCopenhagen, Denmark83 contributions\n0\nCheap but not a great dinner\nOct 2018 • Couples\nWent there with my gf for a dinner.\nWe orded a pizza, pasta, french fries, a glass of red wine and a draught beer.\n\nThe wine glas was only like 10% full and I didnt liked the beer. So i orded a Heineken. The staff didnt understood english so the whole proces was hard.\nThen the pasta came out. We waited 15 min. On the french fries (it wasnt french fries, but potato weedges). We asked where the pizza was because we waited to eat at the same time. They said 10 min.\n\nMy gf wanted mayonnaise for the potatos. After 5 min. They came with chiliketchup!\n\nFinaly we good the pizza. So we ended up eating separatly.\n\nAt last the pasta and pizza was good.\nRead more\nWritten October 3, 2018\nSoho Steak\nThank you for responding. We will try to improve to quality of food and service is better.\nWritten May 9, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
