            "review_text": "gtravel18\nAustralia17 contributions\n0\nAmazing food and service!\nAug 2018 • Friends\nStumbled upon this restaurant and I'm so glad that I did. So much so I returned again whilst in Hanoi. It's a little far away from main Old Quater area but it's in walking distance and worth the walk. The Steak was cooked perfectly, presentation great and the flavour was amazing. Complimentary bread served. Friendly and vibrant staff. Best steak I've had in Vietnam and I've been travelling for close to 3months now. Highly recommend soho steak.\nRead more\nWritten August 7, 2018\nSoho Steak\nThank you for choosing SOHO. We hope to welcome you again and again.\nWritten May 9, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
